---
description: story-loop process for this repository; read before touching stories/tracker.yaml or implementing a story
alwaysApply: false
globs: stories/**
---

Follow `stories/README.md`. The chat session that runs the loop is the coordinator and the only
writer of `status`, `commit`, `ticket` and `log` in `stories/tracker.yaml`. Implementer and
verifier work runs from the briefs in `stories/agents/`, each in a fresh context, and their
reports are saved verbatim under `stories/reviews/`. Never commit or push without an explicit
instruction; never stage local-only process material; one commit per story on `{{BRANCH}}`.
